{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26948","headline":"和刘禹锡主客冬初拜表怀上都故人 · 姚合","name":"和刘禹锡主客冬初拜表怀上都故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九陌喧喧骑吏催，百官拜表禁城开。\n林疎晓日明红叶，尘静寒霜覆绿苔。\n玉佩声微班始定，金函光动按初来。\n此时共想朝天客，谢食方从阁里回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26948.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26948","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}